	(gr_text_box "The Cartridge-Connector footprint has a solder mask expansion of -0.5mm.\nThis will insure that the solder mask overlaps the edge pads a little bit to protect the thin traces.\n\nThe keepout zones are from the OEM NES and are there to prevent any solder mask around the edge connector pads. "
		(start 76.975 145.175)
		(end 113.425 161.8)
		(margins 0.825 0.825 0.825 0.825)
